abstract: A desktop application for aligning multimodal microscopy data using a thin-plate
  spline transformation fitted to matched control points. Supports 2D images and 3D
  serial-sectioning stacks, EBSD formats (.ang, .h5, .dream3d) alongside standard
  image formats, and optional automatic control point detection with a pretrained
  deep-learning matcher.
